Z||000033||Guinea Pig||07-03-2000||01:48 AM||||Well now that we see both the United States and Canada SUCK, I will give a short opinion.<BR>When compared with many other countries, these two North American nations are the BEST.  My wife and I have visited Canada every year since 1985.  We both think it's a great country.  Almost everyone we meet in Canada is friendly and very helpful. <BR> <BR>Sometimes I get a little upset with the way my country seems to dump on Canada, and hope that when we return the warmth of the Canadian people hasn't cooled towards us.  I must add, that most of our experience has been in Ontario, mainly in Toronto and west.<P>We have also met many Canadians in Florida in the winter, and can find nothing ill to say about them. <P>Because of some individual bad happenings in each others country doesn't mean that country SUCKS, just that particular incident did. I'm off the soap box now.<p>[This message has been edited by Guinea Pig (edited 07-03-2000).]||||reg||1
